      "text": "caveat terms \u2014 immutable from the moment they are signed\n\nrootDomainId   treasury          the delegated domain\npredicateId    is a sub-domain of\nmaxDepth       5                 hop cap\nattestor       curator           whose stake counts",
      "fontSize": 13,
