      "x": 514.6,
      "y": 195,
      "width": 440.8,
      "height": 97.5,
      "text": "caveat.args \u2014 a path witness, outside the signed hash\n\n[ micro-grants, builder-grants, grants, treasury ]\n\nOutside the hash on purpose: that is what lets a\ndelegation signed yesterday cover a domain minted today.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "caveat.args \u2014 a path witness, outside the signed hash\n\n[ micro-grants, builder-grants, grants, treasury ]\n\nOutside the hash on purpose: that is what lets a\ndelegation signed yesterday cover a domain minted today.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
