      "x": 510.70000000000005,
      "y": 1139,
      "width": 448.59999999999997,
      "height": 97.5,
      "text": "Whose stake is a signed field\n\nan org address  \u2192  institutional curation\naddress(0)      \u2192  resolves to the delegator, so every\n                    level reads the graph through its own\n                    signer's view of it",
      "fontSize": 13,
