      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Whose stake is a signed field\n\nan org address  \u2192  institutional curation\naddress(0)      \u2192  resolves to the delegator, so every\n                    level reads the graph through its own\n                    signer's view of it",
