      "type": "text",
      "x": 46.80000000000001,
      "y": 1329,
      "width": 456.4,
      "height": 81.25,
      "text": "Widening \u2014 nothing is stored\n\nStake a new edge under treasury and every delegation\nscoped there covers it immediately. No redeploy, no new\nsignature: the next check simply reads a graph that moved.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Widening \u2014 nothing is stored\n\nStake a new edge under treasury and every delegation\nscoped there covers it immediately. No redeploy, no new\nsignature: the next check simply reads a graph that moved.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
