      "type": "text",
      "x": 502.9,
      "y": 1329,
      "width": 464.2,
      "height": 81.25,
      "text": "Narrowing \u2014 nobody coded it\n\nbeforeHook runs per level, so a vote through A\u2192B (treasury)\nand B\u2192C (grants) needs a valid witness for each. The\nintersection is the narrowing \u2014 it falls out of the hook.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Narrowing \u2014 nobody coded it\n\nbeforeHook runs per level, so a vote through A\u2192B (treasury)\nand B\u2192C (grants) needs a valid witness for each. The\nintersection is the narrowing \u2014 it falls out of the hook.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
